<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China Overseas Land suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China Overseas Land suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property investment concern China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of China Overseas Land ended HK$0.15 higher at HK$4.05 on Thursday. Volume was 34.09 million shares worth HK$135.84 million.</p>
<p>Brokers said there was talk that the suspension was related to a share placement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
